<%- include('../../partials/app-head') %>
<%# HQ v2 "Make Claude your admin" (HQ_MCP_BRAIN): the member's own Claude, with their own Gmail and Calendar, works through 127's AI link. Locals: brainOn, skillsOn. %>
<div class="hq h2">
  <%- include('../../partials/hq2-nav') %>
  <div class="hq-head" style="margin-bottom:8px">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Make Claude your admin</span>
      <h1 class="hq-title"><span class="dim">Your email, calendar</span><span class="steel">and business in one chat.</span></h1>
      <p class="hq-lede">Your own Claude reads your inbox and calendar with the connectors you turn on inside Claude, and works with 127 through your AI link. Nothing is sent without your yes.</p>
      <p class="hq-small">Gmail and Calendar connect inside Claude, under your own account with Anthropic. 127 doesn't get your email or calendar unless your Claude sends something to HQ, like a note.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <ol class="h2-stack" style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0">
    <li class="hq-card"><span class="eyebrow">Step 1</span><h2 class="h2-h" style="font-size:18px;margin-top:6px">Add 127 to Claude</h2><p class="h2-sub">Copy your AI link, then in Claude add it as a custom connector (in Claude's settings, under Connectors).</p><a class="hq-pill" style="margin-top:12px" href="/app/hq/connect#ai">Get your AI link</a></li>
    <li class="hq-card"><span class="eyebrow">Step 2</span><h2 class="h2-h" style="font-size:18px;margin-top:6px">Turn on Gmail and Google Calendar in Claude</h2><p class="h2-sub">Same place in Claude's settings. Those connect your Google account to your Claude, not to 127.</p></li>
    <li class="hq-card"><span class="eyebrow">Step 3</span><h2 class="h2-h" style="font-size:18px;margin-top:6px">Add the 127 admin skill</h2><p class="h2-sub">It tells Claude how to run your morning: your numbers, what's waiting in 127, today's meetings with context from your Brain, and replies drafted in your voice for you to check.</p><a class="hq-pill" style="margin-top:12px" href="/app/hq/admin-setup/skill.zip">Download the skill (.zip)</a><p class="hq-small">In Claude's settings, add it under Skills.<% if (skillsOn) { %> Each skill on your <a href="/app/hq/skills">Skills</a> page has its own too.<% } %></p></li>
    <li class="hq-card"><span class="eyebrow">Step 4</span><h2 class="h2-h" style="font-size:18px;margin-top:6px">Say "morning"</h2><p class="h2-sub">Or try: "Draft replies to the emails waiting on me." "Log that we're moving weekly mowing to $50." "What did my sales helper do this week?"</p></li>
  </ol>
  <% if (!brainOn) { %><p class="hq-small">Search and notes in your Brain switch on when your Brain's docs do.</p><% } %>
</div>
<script src="/js/hq2.js" defer></script>
<%- include('../../partials/app-foot') %>
